# Intent Detection Guidelines

## Intent Detection Module
Located in [intent_detect/](mdc:intent_detect/) directory

## Key Files
- **Main Model**: [intent_detect/model.py](mdc:intent_detect/model.py)
- **Training**: [intent_detect/main.py](mdc:intent_detect/main.py)
- **Data Processing**: [intent_detect/dataloader.py](mdc:intent_detect/dataloader.py)
- **Utilities**: [intent_detect/utils.py](mdc:intent_detect/utils.py)

## Pre-trained Models
- **PKU Model**: [intent_detect/pku_128_1e-06_none/ckpt/design_intent_pku_epoch100.pth](mdc:intent_detect/pku_128_1e-06_none/ckpt/design_intent_pku_epoch100.pth)
- **CGL Model**: [intent_detect/cgl_128_1e-06_none/ckpt/design_intent_cgl_epoch35.pth](mdc:intent_detect/cgl_128_1e-06_none/ckpt/design_intent_cgl_epoch35.pth)
