## Training Scripts
- **Training**: [intent_detect/train.sh](mdc:intent_detect/train.sh)
- **Testing**: [intent_detect/test.sh](mdc:intent_detect/test.sh)
- **Preprocessing**: [intent_detect/pp.sh](mdc:intent_detect/pp.sh)

## Model Architecture
- **Base**: UNet with MiT-B1 encoder
- **Input**: RGB images
- **Output**: Design intent maps
- **Resolution**: 128x128 (configurable)

## Integration
- Intent maps used as spatial guidance in main model
- Maps integrated into diffusion process
- Supports both saliency and intent guidance